# ── .mailmap ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unify contributor identities and tag machine-generated commits.
# Format: <Proper Name> <Proper Email> <Commit Name> <Commit Email>
#
# See `git shortlog -sn` and `git log --use-mailmap` for the unified view.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# IDE-assisted commits (auto-saved by editors) — collapse to a bot identity so
